  {
   "id": "chess-knights-shinobi-148133@major-2020-10-09",
   "gameId": "chess-knights-shinobi-148133",
   "displayName": "Major Update: Secret Levels, Collectibles and much more!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-10-09T22:24:15.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Put your black clothes on. It is Shinobi time again.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We are very happy to release a major update, with several new features. Thank you very much for all the support, this game wouldn't be possible without you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "So, let me show you what is new!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "All Levels are now available!",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Ok, that was unexpected! We're still in early access but decided to release the whole game for you. It might have some minor bugs, but we'd love for you to play the whole experience and give us feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The full main narrative has 50 levels in total. Have fun!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Secret \"Surreal\" Levels",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "There are 10 secret levels in the game, where you will need to recover artifacts protected by Shogi pieces.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Is it real or just a bad dream? Well, first you need to find them!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Recover all stollen pieces",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "In each secret level you'll find a special artifact. Solve the puzzle to bring them back to the Dojo and learn more about them.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "We also added a couple more features like",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "controller support for the gameplay;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New cutscenes;",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "A \"highlight moves\" option.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And some minor things :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "---",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "We really hope you have a lot of fun with this game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "And let us know of any issue or suggestion you might have. You just need to post a comment on the Community Hub!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
