  {
   "id": "chess-knights-shinobi-148133@major-2020-09-02",
   "gameId": "chess-knights-shinobi-148133",
   "displayName": "Minor bug-fixing and an Update from the Devs",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2020-09-02T22:23:17.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi guys!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "First of all thank you so much for supporting this little game! You're awesome!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've just uploaded a new build with some minor bug-fixing (all achievements are working now!). You can update your game now and have fun :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Also, we've been working on the next levels and we are pretty excited about it! We are aiming at 50 levels, since the latest puzzles are way more difficult than the ones in the first half of the game.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "You can expect a new update this month (September) with some new levels and general improvements to the game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In the meanwhile, if you still haven't played the first game in the Chess Knights series, I do recommend you play it:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That's all for today, folks!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Once again thanks a lot for all the support and lovely feedbacks. You're awesome!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Raphael",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
